  "title": {
    "zh": "M6s折叠双摄无人机",
    "en": "M6s Folding Dual-Camera Drone"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "灰白色折叠机身配无刷电机、光流定位、双摄和灯光，标称单电池约10分钟飞行。",
    "en": "A gray-and-white folding drone with brushless motors, optical flow, dual cameras and lights; stated flight time is about 10 minutes on one battery."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "灰白色折叠机身配无刷电机、光流定位、双摄和灯光，标称单电池约10分钟飞行。",
      "资料列有高度保持、光流定位、无头模式、一键返航和自定义航线。",
      "机身电池为3.7 V、1300 mAh，遥控器内置3.7 V、500 mAh电池；资料列遥控距离约100 m、图传约40–50 m。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A gray-and-white folding drone with brushless motors, optical flow, dual cameras and lights; stated flight time is about 10 minutes on one battery.",
      "The source lists altitude hold, optical-flow positioning, headless mode, one-key return and custom routes.",
      "The drone battery is listed as 3.7 V, 1,300 mAh and the controller has a built-in 3.7 V, 500 mAh battery."
    ]
  },
