        "Folding Drone with Lights, Propeller Guards and Standard Controller",
        "Gray and white. Folding drone with brushless motors, optical-flow positioning, electronic speed control, and lights. 3.7 V, 1,300 mAh battery (actual capacity as stated). USB charging; adapter sold separately. Charging time is not specified. Remote has a built-in 3.7 V, 500 mAh battery. Stated remote range: about 100 m; video range: about 40–50 m. Features include dual cameras, Wi-Fi, servo-stabilized gimbal, altitude hold, optical-flow positioning, app-drawn routes, app control, one-key return, headless mode, gesture photography, and six-axis gyroscope. Front camera is 480p; downward camera supports optical flow and adjustable angles. Stated flight time is about 10 minutes. Source describes obstacle-stop behavior; verify obstacle-avoidance configuration. Stated weight: 164 g."
